QUIZ

Let’s check your knowledge about the concepts you just learned.


1. Troy is trying to determine if Dean’s information was used in the training data set for a
    predictive AI system. 
    Which of the following describes the kind of attack Troy would use?

    - Individual information attack

    - Personal information attack

    - Membership inference attack ✅

    - Group identity attack

    💡Troy would use a membership inference attack to see if there was any data that would allow
    him to determine if Dean’s information was in the training data set.


2. Which of the following would not be considered personal information (PI)?

    - A person’s name

    - A person’s employer

    - A person’s postal code

    - A person’s favorite color ✅


3. Annie is reviewing what data to collect for the AI model to process. She decides not to collect
    users’ mailing addresses. Which control is Annie employing?

    - Data minimization ✅

    - Data anonymization

    - Differential privacy

    - Model anonymization


4. Ahbed wants to employ privacy controls before his model is deployed. Which of the following
    should he use? Select the two that apply.

    - Model anonymization ✅

    - Data anonymization

    - Data minimization

    - Differential privacy ✅


5. Shirley was arrested for protesting when she in college. Which of the following would this be an
    example of?

    - Harmful personal information

    - Personal information (PI)

    - Sensitive personal information (SPI) ✅

    - Inferential personal information